OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fwill clear to leave a dry evening for
OL,7,Fmost. Then the rest of the night will
OL,8,Fbe dry across all parts with clear
OL,9,Fperiods. Becoming rather chilly.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FThe risk of a few light
OL,12,Fshowers across northern Aberdeenshire
OL,13,Fat first. Otherwise a dry day with
OL,14,Fsunny intervals turning hazier later
OL,15,Fin the day. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
